watchdog
--------

all kinds of browsers tend to create a `Downloads/` directory
in the `home/` directory regardless of your settings.

i have tried lots of different settings and browsers,
and i couldn't stop them from creating the very annoying directory.
so this is a script that just watches if it's
created and removes it automatically.

if you want to use it, you should attach it to your
desktop environment or your shell config. it has to
be running in the background (takes about 3Mb of memory while idle).
